Dataset licensing
=================

The MIT licence in LICENSE covers the code in this repository only.

The APTOS 2019 Blindness Detection images and labels are not included here
and are not covered by it. They are distributed by Kaggle under their own
terms:

    https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/mariaherrerot/aptos2019

Download them yourself and accept those terms before running the pipeline.

External evaluation datasets
----------------------------

The code license does not cover IDRiD, Messidor-2 images, their mirrors or
third-party grading files. Obtain each source under its applicable terms.
No rights to image redistribution are granted by this repository.

The official Messidor-2 provider describes research and educational use,
prohibits redistribution and unauthorized commercial use, and requires
attribution. See https://www.adcis.net/en/third-party/messidor2/.

